---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Tyre">
  <p class="annot annot-tick">Cross-cutting</p>
  <h1 style="margin-top:0.4rem;">Tyre</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--ink-2);margin-top:0.5rem;">
    Download the MATLAB tyre toolset, browse shared fit results, and read the
    Round 8 run table. Built in a later step (BRIEF §E4).
  </p>
  <div class="notice notice-heritage" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
    <strong>Grip caveat stays visible here.</strong> TTC belt-surface grip is not
    track grip — shared results carry that reminder and are anonymised. The
    toolset download sits behind login in private Supabase storage (not a public
    release, not committed to the repo) — licence, BRIEF §G.
  </div>
</Base>
